 "caption": "Drug-free Postsecondary Education Act of 1990; repeal Article 2 of Chapter 1",
 "summary": "A BILL to be entitled an Act to amend Title 20 of the Official Code of Georgia Annotated, relating to education, so as to repeal Article 2 of Chapter 1, the \"Drug-free Postsecondary Education Act of 1990\"; to remove provisions making students convicted of certain drug offenses ineligible for loans, scholarships, and grants; to provide that students shall not be deemed ineligible for HOPE scholarships or grants based solely on certain convictions; to provide for related matters; to repeal conflicting laws; and for other purposes.",
